@base = http://localhost:5080
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Salud
GET {{base}}/health

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@sporthub.com","password":"SportHub2026!"}

### Catálogo protegido
GET {{base}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear producto
POST {{base}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Producto de prueba","description":"Prueba API","price":120.50,"stock":10,"category":"Accesorios","brand":"Nova","color":"#ad92ff"}

### Crear venta con producto existente
POST {{base}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerName":"Cliente de prueba","notes":"Prueba HTTP","items":[{"productId":1,"quantity":2}]}
